STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT Ozma 12: the system font of the Glider 4 port.
COMMENT The glyphs of the Chicago 12 bitmap font, from the System file of Executor
COMMENT (https://github.com/autc04/executor, MIT license), re-encoded.
COMMENT Character 0x14, Chicago's Apple logo, is a diamond here.
COMMENT The MAC_ properties keep QuickDraw font metrics; the missing-character glyph is ENCODING -1.
FONT Ozma-12
SIZE 12 72 72
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 13 15 0 -3
STARTPROPERTIES 11
FAMILY_NAME "Ozma"
PIXEL_SIZE 12
POINT_SIZE 120
FONT_ASCENT 12
FONT_DESCENT 3
DEFAULT_CHAR -1
MAC_LEADING 1
MAC_WIDMAX 14
MAC_KERNMAX 0
MAC_NDESCENT -12
MAC_FRECTWIDTH 14
ENDPROPERTIES
